---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Productivity Software Reviews explaining what information we collect, how cookies and affiliate links work, and your privacy rights."
>
  <div class="prose-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="badge">Legal &amp; Privacy</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Last updated: November 8, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="prose-section">
      <p>
        At <strong>Productivity Software Reviews</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to keeping this website fast, transparent, and respectful of your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains what information is collected when you visit our site and how it is used.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information You Voluntarily Provide</h2>
      <p>
        We only collect personal information (such as your name and email address) when you voluntarily submit it to us—for example, by sending a message through our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> or emailing our editorial team directly. We use this information solely to respond to your inquiry and never sell or rent your email address to third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Automatic Log Data &amp; Privacy-Friendly Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, our static hosting provider may automatically record standard technical information when your browser requests a page, including your browser type, referring URL, operating system, and anonymized IP address for security and performance monitoring.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Cookies &amp; Affiliate Referral Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        When you click on an outbound link to a software vendor that participates in an affiliate program, that vendor or its affiliate network (such as Impact, PartnerStack, or Rewardful) may place a temporary referral cookie in your browser to credit our website if you choose to purchase a subscription.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>These cookies do not give us access to your personal identity, billing details, or account data on the vendor's platform.</li>
        <li>You can clear or block cookies at any time using your browser settings.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Websites</h2>
      <p>
        Our reviews link to external SaaS websites. Once you leave Productivity Software Reviews, any information you provide on a software vendor's website is governed by that vendor's own privacy policy and terms of service.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your Data Rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location, you have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal correspondence you have shared with us. To exercise these rights, please contact us via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header h1 {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
</style>
